{"id":"632348","name":"咖喱牛肉饭","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/632348/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"400g"}],"sub":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"2个"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"1个"},{"name":"咖喱","amount":"100g"},{"name":"葱姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉用刀背按摩。","img":"images/632348/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"牛肉切丁冷水锅烧开撇浮沫。","img":"images/632348/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入葱、姜、八角、料酒，煮40分钟。","img":"images/632348/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"洋葱、胡萝卜、土豆切丁备用。","img":"images/632348/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"准备咖喱100g。","img":"images/632348/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅热倒油。","img":"images/632348/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"下洋葱煸炒。","img":"images/632348/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加胡萝卜丁继续翻炒。","img":"images/632348/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加土豆丁翻炒三分钟。","img":"images/632348/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入牛肉和汤水。","img":"images/632348/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"汤汁没过食材。盖盖子中火煮15分钟。","img":"images/632348/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入咖喱块。","img":"images/632348/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"小火焖煮至汤汁粘稠。","img":"images/632348/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"盛米饭装盘。","img":"images/632348/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"一起吃咖喱饭吧！","img":"images/632348/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}